%h3 Welcome to suSSHi Chef
%br
%p Please scan the QR code with your favorite authenticator app or securely store the OTP secret to add it manually.
= form_for("", url: users_sessions_commit_otp_path, method: :post, html: { role: 'form', class: 'm-t'}) do |f|
  = image_tag @otp_qr_code
  %p.font-bold
    %span.text-muted= @otp_secret
  %br
  %p
  = f.submit  'Confirm', class: 'btn btn-primary block full-width m-b'
